WEBVTT

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:34.440
This is Saturn.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:36.950
It really does have rings!

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.610
Here's Venus.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.050
It's so bright!

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:42.280
You can see it clearly even with the naked eye.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:43.790
Spica!

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:46.000
The brightest star in the constellation Virgo,

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.800
it's also called the Pearl Star in Japan.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.000
Wow, the Pearl Star!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.000
And, that hazy-looking stuff is...

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.620
The Milky Way!

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:57.880
It really is hazy.

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:01.960
It's because of all the 
city lights, even in Hanno.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.450
Look at this!

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.560
It's a firefly!

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:09.900
The firefly...

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.720
went away already.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.420
What's wrong, Hinata?

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:21.840
Do you dislike fireflies?

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.360
N-No, that's not it.

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:25.660
Huh?

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:30.500
I know! Aoi-san, Hinata-san, 
would you like to go see fireflies?

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.250
There's a lovely place where you 
can view a whole lot of them!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.000
A whole lot?

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.060
Yes, very many.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:41.600
When I was little, I loved fireflies 
so much that I even wanted to be one!

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.640
You wanted to be a firefly...

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.390
That does sound like you.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.930
Mom would often take me to that place.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:54.900
With the fireflies and the twinkling stars, 
it felt like I was floating in space.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.420
That sounds great!

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.390
Hey, Hinata, let's go!

00:02:58.390 --> 00:02:59.790
Okay...

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:02.780
Then, I'll contact Kaede-san too.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.410
I can't wait to go see the fireflies!

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.160
Mountain Trail

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:07.910
Season 2 - New Climb 13

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.410
Season 2 - New Climb 13 
 The Tale of the Mysterious Firefly

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:11.580
A yukata?

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:17.200
We're all going to wear yukata
 and go see fireflies at Lake Naguri.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.200
Mom, don't you have a yukata?

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:22.520
I do, but it might be a bit big on you.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.670
Want to try it on after eating?

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:25.930
Sure!

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.550
That reminds me,

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:32.650
we once went to see the fireflies around 
Lake Naguri when you were little.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:33.940
Don't you remember?

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.360
I believe it was when you were in kindergarten.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.070
Our family went with Hinata's family.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.190
Fireflies, huh...

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:47.830
I've kinda got a dim memory of them...

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:52.080
Aoi-chan, let's go over there!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.430
Sure, Hinata-chan!

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.170
We're lost!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.480
Dad! Mom!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.840
Don't cry, we'll be fine.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.600
<i>Firefly!</i>

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.610
<i>There's no such thing as a firefly ghost!</i>

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:23.140
<i>It must've been something from a dream 
that I got mixed up with that memory!</i>

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.490
I wonder if Aoi remembers it...

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.170
Those don't exist, silly!

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.240
Hinata, you're such a child!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.390
She'll definitely laugh at me!

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:39.340
She's the kind to do that.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.960
She didn't even remember me!

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:46.720
Oh dear, are you all right?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.140
Y-Yeah...

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.760
So, Hinata and I got lost?

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.360
Hinata-chan cried up a storm!

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.350
It was a big fuss!

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.280
Hinata cried?

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:00.110
Maybe I'll tease her about that.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.470
Oh, also...

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:03.110
At that time, you said...

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.450
Know what? A fairy led us back here!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.950
A firefly fairy!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.380
A fairy?

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.460
I wonder just what you actually saw.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.720
Don't cry, Hinata-chan.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.840
We'll be okay.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.730
Come, this way.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.730
Follow me.

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:50.490
<i>I remember now.</i>

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.470
<i>I'm pretty sure we met a firefly fairy then.</i>

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.370
<i>I wonder if Hinata remembers it...</i>

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.580
<i>Oh, wait...</i>

00:05:56.820 --> 00:06:00.520
A fairy? Those don't exist, silly!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:02.380
You're such a child!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.440
She'll definitely make fun of me!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.640
She's the kind to do that.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.130
I won't mention it.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.640
Hey!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.230
Here I am!

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:21.520
What?

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:25.230
Clothes make the man, but a yukata makes Aoi!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:29.280
Well, I could say the same for you!

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:36.130
Speaking of, Hinata, didn't you cry up a storm 
when we went to see the fireflies long ago?!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.590
You remember that?!

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:41.110
No, Mom told me about it.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.530
Oh, I see.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.850
I guess I did.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.590
<i>I can't believe she didn't 
remember that firefly ghost.</i>

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:52.840
<i>I wonder if she remembers that firefly fairy.</i>

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.770
<i>Yeah, I won't mention it.</i>

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.810
Thanks for waiting!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.340
Kokona-chan!

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:02.970
You're so cute!

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:06.990
You look lovely too, Hinata-san and Aoi-san.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.470
This is a hand-me-down from Mom.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.530
Where'd you get your yukata, Kokona-chan?

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:14.780
Actually, I sewed it myself.

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:16.790
That's way impressive!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:20.890
Mom has made clothes and things 
for me for a very long time,

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:24.000
so I followed her example.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.000
Sorry I'm late, everyone!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.480
Oh! Kaede...san?

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.380
Boy, it sure is hot!

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:31.390
That's way casual!

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:34.140
Huh? You guys went all out!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.470
On the phone, I said, 
"Let's meet up in yukata"...

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.680
Oh, did you?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.050
Well, no worries then.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.480
Let's go!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.280
River Fun

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:57.660
Be careful! 
Wait for me!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.090
It's dangerous!

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:02.570
I didn't know there was 
a place like this in Hanno.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:06.460
It's an ideal spot for viewing fireflies.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.990
This is probably the place 
we came when we were little.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.460
Y-Yeah...

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.680
I'm tired!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.800
Firefly viewers: 
We request a donation 
of 100 yen/person 
for park maintenance.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.290
It's gotten pretty crowded.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.350
Let's go somewhere with fewer people.

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:27.830
Is it about time?

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:28.440
Yes!

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:30.300
It's getting dark pretty quick...

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:33.190
It feels like anything could appear!

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.740
Don't say weird stuff!

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.870
You know there's no such thing as ghosts!

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:41.160
Ghosts?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.500
What do you mean?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.580
B-Back then, you saw it too, 
right? The firefly ghost!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.490
What are you talking about, Hinata?

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.840
That was a firefly fairy!

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.150
Don't be silly!

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:54.050
There's no such thing as fairies!

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.930
What was that for? I thought 
you said <i>ghosts</i> don't exist!

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.880
Hinata-san? Aoi-san?

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.810
What's with you two?

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:09.730
It's pitch dark.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.700
Fireflies!

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.710
So pretty...

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:32.840
Look!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.480
Hinata, look up!

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:56.350
Up?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.380
Stars in the sky...

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:05.950
Fireflies on the ground...

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:09.040
It's like we're in outer space.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:12.420
We're swimming in a sea of stars!

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:15.010
This is so incredible!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.210
It feels like...

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:19.430
Yeah, it really feels like 
anything could appear!

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:28.980
Later!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.030
Be careful on your way home, everyone.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:32.080
Okay!

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.770
Good night!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:40.700
I'm home!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.070
Welcome home, Kokona.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:45.350
I bought box meals, wanna eat?

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:46.140
Yeah!

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.750
How were the fireflies?

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:51.490
They were very sparkly and beautiful.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.130
Glad to hear it.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:56.510
I wish you could've gone with us, Mom.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.170
I had to work, so I couldn't.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:00.920
Oh, that's right!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.970
I believe it was in here...

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.250
Remember this?

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:11.740
You wore this when we went to 
see the fireflies together.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.270
Right!

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:16.090
When I said I wanted to be a firefly,

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.870
you made me this costume.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:23.280
Come, come, come, firefly!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:27.290
Now I am a firefly, so here I come!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.410
Huh?

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:32.080
Don't cry, we'll be okay.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.050
Are you lost?

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:37.420
I'll lead you back to where everybody is.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.680
<i>It's a firefly ghost!</i>

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.390
<i>It's a fairy!</i>

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:58.940
Come, come, come, firefly!
